{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-09/1064849/block/singleImage/3273300/wm/01M26VV4ZFRQ4W5DT15XRZ71QP.jpg?updatedAt=1795160921\"/><figcaption>淺水灣泳灘女子疑仰藥輕生，救生員發現昏迷送院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (20 日 ) 上午近 9 時，警方接獲救生員報寑，指發現一名女子昏迷在淺水灣一號泳灘上。 人員接報到場，發現該名40歲姓周女子旁邊有懷疑藥物包裝，她昏迷被送往律敦治醫院治理。警方於現場檢獲遺書，正調查事主身份及事件經過，案件列作「企圖自殺」跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:04:03.384938+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:06:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T14:17:16.457269+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T07:57:23.456338+00:00","content_hash":"1e2ad41606f53bf68aa8a4514626be1d9e0aaefbde981b4d42d9793b66f0b7dd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:04:03.384938+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}